{"seq":3,"slug":"scaling-context-across-the-repo","title":"Scaling Context Across The Repo","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/scaling-context-across-the-repo","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"root-vs-package-level-context","title":"根级与包级上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/scaling-context-across-the-repo/root-vs-package-level-context","wordCount":2147,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"context-for-monorepos","title":"Monorepo 的上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/scaling-context-across-the-repo/context-for-monorepos","wordCount":1828,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"pointers-not-duplication","title":"用指针而非重复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/scaling-context-across-the-repo/pointers-not-duplication","wordCount":1672,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲上下文文件在一个大仓库里怎么组织才不乱:根级放全项目通用的(栈、全局约定、怎么装跑验),包级/目录级放只有那块才需要的局部约定与坑,让 agent 在每个地方都读到\"全局 + 该处局部\"而不过载;monorepo 尤其需要这种分层——一个仓库装多个包,各包有各自的栈、约定、命令,全堆根级既臃肿又互相干扰,就近放才让 agent 在某个包里工作时读到那个包的上下文;贯穿始终的原则是用指针而非重复——同一份知识只写一处,别处用链接/引用指过去,避免多份拷贝随时间各自漂移、互相矛盾,让 agent 读到自相矛盾的上下文。\n"}